guide polestar-experimental/hyjal-1
title Mount Hyjal
levels 57-60 Alliance
levels 57-60 Horde
zone Mount Hyjal
coords live
why About 100 quests in Forever's new endgame zone, 57 to 59.
keywords mount hyjal, hyjal, tainted foothills, felblood scar, ketharas, moonglade, barkskin burrow, elderwild, mourning's rest, cradle of tranquility, shrine of aviana, dae'gun, summit of eternity, nordrassil, experimental, alpha
next forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus
next forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus
pitch A new Forever zone south of Winterspring.
pro About 350,000 quest experience
pro No boat: Everlook is a flight away
pro Two flight paths inside the zone
con Bring help: elites line the gorge

# Polestar Experimental, Mount Hyjal part 1 of 3, for both factions (2026-11-12; the Horde's hand-off since 0.4.3).
# Hand-written. Quests, givers, enders, levels and objectives come from Forever's quest data (QuestieDB 1.0.16 and
# EG Link, as merged into data/forever); the order, the objective spots and the chain links the data lacks come from
# players' recordings: the first Alliance player (levels 57 to 60), then six Alliance players who followed this guide
# and eight Horde players who quested through the zone (levels 55 to 60, 2026-11). The Horde steps (Thark Gorax,
# the Western Post, Elderwild's Zet'gan, Ortak Lomgok and Kal'tinzan, Faustron's Moonglade flight path, Thisalee's
# hand-in) are each confirmed by six or seven of those Horde players.
# The Alliance comes here as a route choice at the end of the Western Plaguelands guide (50-60/04), the Horde at the
# end of the Eastern Plaguelands guide (50-60/05), whose last stop is Everlook; both go back to their 50-60/06.
# Order: the way in from Everlook through Darkwhisper Gorge (binding the Hearthstone there), Ketharas the hermit
# and his first errands by the road, the Tainted Foothills in one loop (Kaylaena's workshop, the ancients' outpost
# and its flight path, the fields south and the shrub field), Ketharas again, the outpost, Felblood Scar (the
# Curious Crow and Felflick), Velician, then Ketharas's errand to Moonglade (by Hearthstone to Everlook when it is
# bound there and ready) with the parts order from Everlook on the way back.
# Offered only after another quest is handed in (the recording; one player, so leads to confirm): Violence Into
# Verdure after Seeds for a New Season, The Bounty of Nature after Hope for Hatchlings, Rites of Respect after The
# Bounty of Nature, Ancient Allies after Rites of Respect; Bark Bite after Leaves to Ligatures; Fine Feathered
# Friend and The Dying Ancients after Bark Bite; Felflick's chain one quest at a time; A Revenge Now Bitter after
# Amalgamated Marrow; A Prolific Source and Prickly Pinecones after Notation, Notation, Notation; The Experimental
# Method after A Prolific Source; The Western Post after The Experimental Method; An Oldstone But An Old Friend
# after The Dying God; Rubble Rummage after Crate Expectations; The Capricious Corvid and Taking to New Heights
# after The Pact.
# Behind a group choice: Celastrus the Bitter (91923), The Dying Ancients (92959) and Amalgamated Marrow (96255):
# Celastrus, Sunderbark and the Awakened Fel Ash Slime are elites (levels 57, 56 and 58), and A Revenge Now Bitter
# (96322) comes only after Amalgamated Marrow. The slime rose the moment A Fitting End was handed in at the bone
# pile in the recording, before Amalgamated Marrow was taken, so that step warns everyone. Ghansurok (elite 61)
# prowls around Kaylaena's workshop (the data's spawns and the recording's sightings).
# Not in the recording, from the quest data alone: Venom Maws (96833) and One Person's Trash (94479).
# The ride in (0.4.3): Frostmaul Giants and Preservers (elite, 59-60) stand on both sides of the road through
# Frostwhisper Gorge, and Hederine Slayers, Initiates and Manastalkers (elite, 57-58) line Darkwhisper Gorge from its
# mouth (about 59.5,75) to the zone line, with Lady Hederine (61) on its east side. Thirteen recorded crossings all
# took the same line, which the step's waypoints follow; nobody killed one of the elites, and four of the six
# Alliance players who followed this guide died on the way in (levels 55.5 to 58.4).

step Reach Everlook
  only Alliance
  when !zone "Mount Hyjal"
  when !zone "Winterspring"
  when taxi "Everlook"
  tip Fly to Everlook if its flight path is known. Wait there for help before entering the elite-lined gorge; use the Silithus route if you are alone.
  fly "Everlook"

step Reach Everlook
  only Horde
  when !zone "Mount Hyjal"
  when !zone "Winterspring"
  when taxi "Everlook"
  tip Fly to Everlook if its flight path is known. Wait there for help before entering the elite-lined gorge; use the Silithus route if you are alone.
  fly "Everlook"

step Into Mount Hyjal
  when !zone "Mount Hyjal"
  tip Experimental route (alpha). It is written from Forever's quest data and players' recordings of the zone, and some steps are not checked in game yet: if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.
  tip Mount Hyjal lies south of Winterspring. Bind your Hearthstone at Everlook's inn, then ride south down the road through Frostwhisper Gorge and on through Darkwhisper Gorge, which leads up into Mount Hyjal: partway through this guide Ketharas sends you to Moonglade, and the way there starts in Everlook.
  tip Careful: elites stand along the whole way in. Frostmaul Giants and Preservers (59-60) flank the road through Frostwhisper Gorge, and Hederine Slayers, Initiates and Manastalkers (57-58) line Darkwhisper Gorge from its mouth to the zone line, with Lady Hederine (61) on its east side. The arrows mark the road, not a safe gap between patrols. Wait for help at Everlook. Below 57, stay with the group for the foothill camps too. If you are alone, choose the Silithus guide instead.
  tip If Everlook is not on your flight map, ride through Timbermaw Hold from northern Felwood, then follow the road east through Winterspring to town. Learn your side's flight path before leaving the inn.
  zone Winterspring
  getfp "Everlook" npc 11138 only Alliance
  getfp "Everlook" npc 11139 only Horde
  sethome "Everlook" npc 11118          -- Innkeeper Vizzie
  goto 62.3,67.0 "The road through Frostwhisper Gorge"
  goto 60.3,73.0 "The mouth of Darkwhisper Gorge"
  goto 59.2,76.5
  goto 61.2,79.5
  goto 61.1,81.5
  goto 58.3,82.2 "Turn west here"
  goto 56.6,80.7
  goto 55.6,83.0
  goto 53.5,84.6
  goto 50.5,83.2 "Into Mount Hyjal"
  zone Mount Hyjal
  enter "Mount Hyjal" @85.5,73.2

step The road in
  tip Experimental route (alpha): if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.
  tip Quintus Wainworth (Alliance) and Thark Gorax (Horde) wait together by the road a little inside the zone.
  accept 96833 only Alliance            -- Venom Maws: for Ketharas, the hermit
  accept 96830 only Horde               -- Farsight Guided: for Ortak Lomgok in Elderwild, later in this guide; keep it

step Loose Cog
  tip The cog lies by the path south-west of the camp, on your way to Ketharas.
  accept 94479                          -- One Person's Trash

step Ketharas
  tip Ketharas, the hermit, lives at the Hermit's Abode a little further south-west.
  turnin 96833 only Alliance
  turnin 94479
  accept 95568                          -- Seeds for a New Season
  accept 95569                          -- Hope for Hatchlings
  accept 96796                          -- Woods Workshop: for Kaylaena, on the way

