step The shrub field
  tip North into the shrub field: the Tainted Shrubbery drop the leaves, and the Scarlet Dart Tubers grow in the open ground, most of them in the field's western half. The ruined ballista stands at the field's north-eastern edge: plant the last seed there. Keep clear of Celastrus the Bitter and Sunderbark, the field's elites.
  kill 248395 x15 quest 92594.1         -- Tainted Shrubbery
  collect 247892 x12 quest 91755.1      -- Verdant Leaves
  collect 267289 x6 quest 93759.2 @59.5,73.5  -- Scarlet Dart Tuber
  complete 93747 @70.4,70.7             -- the Ruined Ballista

