step The bone pile
  tip West to the bone pile by the slime pools: throw the warlocks' bones on it, then hand the quest in at the pile itself. Handing it in wakes the Awakened Fel Ash Slime, an elite (level 58) that hits hard: unless you are grouped for it, hand in and ride clear at once.
  complete 96435 @40.8,80.3
  turnin 96435                          -- Bone Pile

