  when zone "Mount Hyjal"
  when taxi "Moonglade"
  when taxi "Everlook"
  tip Open Bluebell's flight map at the Tainted Foothills. Take Moonglade if she offers it. If she lists only Everlook, fly there and change for Moonglade.
  goto 55.1,82.6 "Bluebell, the flight mistress"
  fly "Moonglade"

