  when zone "Mount Hyjal"
  when !taxi "Moonglade"
  when taxi "Everlook"
  tip Fly from Bluebell to Everlook if it is on her flight map. Stay out of the gorge.
  goto 55.1,82.6 "Bluebell, the flight mistress"
  fly "Everlook"

