step Safe passage from Hyjal
  when zone "Mount Hyjal"
  tip Check Bluebell's flight map. Take Moonglade only if she offers it. A druid who knows Teleport: Moonglade can go directly. If your Hearthstone is bound in Everlook, wait for it to be ready; otherwise arrange a summon to Moonglade or pause the guide here. Do not leave through the gorge on your own.
  enter "Moonglade"

step Fly to Moonglade
  only Alliance
  when zone "Winterspring"
  when taxi "Moonglade"
  tip Check your flight map at Everlook and take Moonglade if it is offered. If you cannot fly, arrange safe passage to Nighthaven.
  fly "Moonglade"

step Fly to Moonglade
  only Horde
  when zone "Winterspring"
  when taxi "Moonglade"
  tip Check your flight map at Everlook and take Moonglade if it is offered. If you cannot fly, arrange safe passage to Nighthaven.
  fly "Moonglade"

step Reach Moonglade
  when !zone "Moonglade"
  tip If you can safely use Timbermaw Hold from Winterspring or Felwood, take the Moonglade passage. Otherwise arrange a summon to Nighthaven, use Teleport: Moonglade if you know it, or pause here. Don't go through Darkwhisper Gorge.
  enter "Moonglade"

