step Bethra'zel
  when group 96003
  when onquest 96003
  tip North-east to Bethra'zel. Drain him first: use Elaena's eye on him, and only then fight him. Undrained, he and Mazzogore are level 60 elites. Doomguard Xarkul, an elite (level 61), walks this corner of Dae'gun: keep out of his way.
  tip Careful: Legion Hulks (60, rare elites) stomp through Dae'gun's camps: give them room.
  use 271879 quest 96003.1             -- Eye of Endless Influence: drain before attacking
  kill 263394 quest 96003.1             -- Bethra'zel

step Maerion Thaelemaches
  tip Maerion Thaelemaches waits a little further north-east. His Felhound Spikes come from the Defiling Hounds, and in our only recording about one hound in ten had one: kill the hounds around him while you are here, and leave his quest if the twelve spikes are slow to come.
  accept 97009                          -- Maerion Thaelemaches: Maerion's Misery
  collect 276100 x12 quest 97009.1 optional  -- Felhound Spike
  turnin 97009 optional

step Mazzogore
  when group 96003
  when onquest 96003
  tip South-west to Mazzogore the Weak, in the middle of Dae'gun: drain him with the eye first, as Bethra'zel, then kill him. Undrained, he is a level 60 elite.
  tip Careful: Doomguards (elites, 58-59) stand around him: pull him out to you.
  use 271879 quest 96003.2             -- Eye of Endless Influence: drain before attacking
  kill 252457 quest 96003.2             -- Mazzogore the Weak

