step The Summit of Eternity
  tip East up to the Summit of Eternity, the druids' camp. Fayran Elthas, the flight master, stands at its north end; Marn Euhorn, Toron Rockhoof and Thisalee Crow along the path south; Tiala Whitemane indoors next to Thisalee; Sebelia, the innkeeper, at the south-east end.
  getfp "Summit of Eternity" @68.7,44.1  -- Fayran Elthas, at the flight point
  turnin 96991                          -- Marn Euhorn
  turnin 91688 only Alliance            -- Thisalee Crow
  turnin 95248 only Horde
  sethome "Summit of Eternity" npc 243815  -- Sebelia

