step Back to Elderwild
  only Horde
  when onquest 91794,96998
  tip Horde: ride west across the foothills and north up the valley to Elderwild, about four minutes, for Kal'tinzan's flags and Zet'gan's war paint wrap. The Hearthstone then takes you back up to the Summit.
