step The Summit's Blackthorne quests
  when group 93584
  tip A group stop: the Blackthorne camps north-east of the Summit hold elite Outrunners, Priests and a Courier (60) as often as the Cultists and Adepts, with Ve'han Talongrasp (60, elite) in the middle and Ghansurok (61, elite) on the ridge. Grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Skip these if you are alone.
  accept 92017                          -- Marn Euhorn: Cleansing Winds
  accept 92533                          -- Toron Rockhoof: Twisted Tools
  accept 93584                          -- Thisalee Crow: Cult Closure
  accept 93407                          -- Tiala Whitemane: A Thorn in the Paw

step Tiala Whitemane
  when group 93584
  accept 92169                          -- Paying Back the Pact

step The Blackthorne camps
  when group 93584
  when onquest 92169
  tip The Blackthorne cultists camp on the slopes north-east of the Summit (level 60, with elite Outrunners, Priests and a Courier among them: pull carefully). Ve'han Talongrasp, an elite (level 60) who leads them, stands among them: leave him be. Ghansurok, an elite chimaera (level 61), also roams the ridge north of the camps.
  tip Use Tiala's staff on a Pact member to strip its ward, then kill it, ten times: pick Cultists and Adepts, whom Thisalee wants dead too. The Cultists carry the kris and the Adepts the staff; the thorn seeds lie in the woods there, and the hippogryphs and chimaeras roam the slopes all around. Not finished in our recordings yet: if something here is off, tell us.
  complete 92169 @75.9,35.4             -- Paying Back the Pact
  kill 249551 x10 quest 93584.1         -- Blackthorne Cultist
  kill 264570 x10 quest 93584.2         -- Blackthorne Adept
